hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16830","Abd Allah narrated to us, he said: Ubayd Allah ibn Umar al-Qawariri and Khalaf ibn Hisham narrated to us, they said: Amir ibn Abi Amir al-Khazzaz narrated to us from Ayyub ibn Musa from his father from his grandfather, he said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: No father grants his child a gift better than good manners."
